BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tough Lies: In Conversation with Jesse Wente
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261029T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261029T200000
UID:bm-6546320261029@shop.queenbooks.ca
DESCRIPTION:[Off-site]\nAward-winning author Jesse Wente shares his highly
 -anticipated new book exploring how we can heal from colonialism.\n\nIn To
 ugh Lies\, Wente explores his own healing path and how it informs what he 
 sees as necessary for reconciliation between Nations\, asking us to consid
 er several pressing questions.\nQ&A and book signing to follow. Books avai
 lable for purchase. For tickets\, visit the\nEventbrite\n.
LOCATION:North York Central Library
URL:https://shop.queenbooks.ca/events
